{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/fred2005-formal-groups/blocks/def-commutative-formal-group","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:commutative-formal-group","kind":"definition","title":"Commutative formal group","cites":["references/hazewinkel1978","references/leitner2006"],"tags":["formal-group","commutative"],"leanRef":"fred2005:Fred2005.CommutativeFormalGroup","text":"commutative-formal-group.md","leanSource":"commutative-formal-group.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:commutative-formal-group\"></a><p>An <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n</code>-dimensional <strong>formal group law</strong> over a commutative ring <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code> is\nan <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n</code>-tuple of power series <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">F(X, Y) \\in R[[X_1, \\dots, X_n, Y_1, \\dots, Y_n]]^n</code>\nwith</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  F(X, 0) = X, \\qquad F(0, Y) = Y, \\qquad F(F(X, Y), Z) = F(X, F(Y, Z)).</code></pre>\n<p>It is <strong>commutative</strong> if in addition <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">F(X, Y) = F(Y, X)</code>.</p>\n<p>A formal group in the sense of <span class=\"cite\" data-keys=\"leitner2006\">[leitner2006]</span>, §2, is a group object in\nsmooth formal varieties over <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>; a choice of coordinates presents it as a\nformal group law. The paper works over a field <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k</code> of characteristic <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p > 0</code>.</p>\n<p>Reference: <span class=\"cite\" data-keys=\"hazewinkel1978\">[hazewinkel1978]</span>, Chapter I; <span class=\"cite\" data-keys=\"leitner2006\">[leitner2006]</span>, §2.</p>\n","source":"folio/fred2005-formal-groups/formal-groups-chapter/commutative-formal-group.md","heading":"Definition","number":"1.1.1","page":"b/def-commutative-formal-group","qa":{"counts":{"pass":68,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":18,"unknown":0,"stale":44}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"fred2005:Fred2005.CommutativeFormalGroup","via":"sibling","path":"folio/fred2005-formal-groups/formal-groups-chapter/commutative-formal-group.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
